    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 134,
     "text": "Turning birdies into real impact on and off the course"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 135,
     "text": "As the Official Pharmaceutical Sponsor of the PGA TOUR, AbbVie is launching Birdies for Brain Health, a campaign that turns birdies into increased awareness and support for people living with neurological and mental health conditions and their care partners who support them."
