  {
   "section": "band",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "About Birdies for Brain Health"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "As Official Pharmaceutical Sponsor of the 2026 Presidents Cup, AbbVie launched the campaign by making a $330,000 donation in recognition of the 33% of the global population affected by a neurological disorder . Beginning in 2027, Birdies for Brain Health will expand across the PGA TOUR season, with a donation for every birdie scored at PGA TOUR Signature Events and the FedExCup Playoffs. These donations will benefit six patient advocacy organizations advancing research and support for people and care partners affected by migraine, mental health conditions, and Parkinson’s disease."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "1"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Throughout the season, compelling stories from individuals - including members of the golf community - will shine a light on the realities of living with neurological and mental health conditions. The campaign connects every birdie to a greater purpose, driving advocacy and action in support of brain health."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "1. World Health Organization. “Global status report on neurology.” October 2025. Accessed Aug. 5, 2026."
    }
   ],
